# Normalise line endings across machines.
#
# Git for Windows sets core.autocrlf=true system-wide, which materialises CRLF
# on checkout; macOS and Linux leave LF. That makes the same commit produce
# different bytes on different hosts. Pinning eol=lf here overrides autocrlf on
# every platform, so a checkout is identical everywhere - Windows editors and
# the xtensa toolchain both handle LF fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these.
*.bin  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
